{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YFXXYJ4ZTKGFGwAFYwfmZr","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 2 从 ''phase transition in trace informativeness'' 改为 ''diagnostic\n2\t  signal concentrates in trace tail with diminishing returns; information density\n3\t  — not gradient dilution — is the primary bottleneck''。tail-384 在四模型上均落在 256→512\n4\t  的 43-53% 位置（83-88%）， 确认 smooth gradient 而非 sharp boundary。Budget curve 四模型趋势一致（log-shaped  diminishing\n5\t  returns），但无共同拐点——每个模型的 steepest gain 区间长度和位置略有不同。 Budget curve 从 standalone finding\n6\t  降为 supporting figure，label_only 26/74 分解升为  Claim 2 sole quantitative evidence。补偿措施:\n7\t  (a) tail-512≫head-2048（~94% vs ~79%,  Δ≈15pp）作为 information locality 的 strong evidence；(b)\n8\t  exception_only scale invariance （1.5B=7B=13B=99.83%）提升至更高叙事位置；(c) cross-model calibration\n9\t  (plan_019, 1h) +  error analysis (plan_018, 0h) 增加独立 evidence 维度。cross-seed σ~1-3pp\n10\t  不否定趋势但 削弱 point estimate 精度，所有 budget curve 数字需附 uncertainty band。仍冲 Main， Findings\n11\t  作 fallback。\n12\t\n13\t  '\n14\timagined_experiments:\n15\t- name: fine_grained_phase_transition_tail384\n16\t  plan_id: plan_016\n17\t  description: tail-384 × 4 models，精确定位 256→512 区间 transition 形态\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    qwen7b_tail384_accuracy: 0.856\n20\t    qwen7b_tail384_ci:\n21\t    - 0.835\n22\t    - 0.877\n23\t    qwen7b_sharpness_index: 0.52\n24\t    deepseek_tail384_accuracy: 0.843\n25\t    deepseek_tail384_ci:\n26\t    - 0.821\n27\t    - 0.865\n28\t    deepseek_sharpness_index: 0.46\n29\t    qwen15b_tail384_accuracy: 0.832\n30\t    qwen15b_tail384_ci:\n31\t    - 0.808\n32\t    - 0.854\n33\t    qwen15b_sharpness_index: 0.44\n34\t    codellama13b_tail384_accuracy: 0.883\n35\t    codellama13b_tail384_ci:\n36\t    - 0.863\n37\t    - 0.903\n38\t    codellama13b_sharpness_index: 0.54\n39\t    four_model_mean: 0.854\n40\t    four_model_std_pp: 2.23\n41\t    mean_sharpness_index: 0.49\n42\t    all_models_gradual: true\n43\t  result_rationale: 'median 档定义 tail-384 在多数模型上 83-89%，transition 为 smooth gradient。\n44\t    推导逻辑：exception events 集中在 trace 末尾（crash point + stack trace）， tail-256 捕获 assertion\n45\t    结果和 traceback 尾部但常截断中段 context；tail-384  额外覆盖约 128 tokens 的 traceback context（调用栈前几帧、变量快照），提供  incremental\n46\t    而非 step-function 式的信息增益。四模型 sharpness index 均在  0.44-0.54 范围（center 0.49，几乎正好\n47\t    midpoint），没有模型出现 <0.3（sharp  stay at 256 level）或 >0.7（sharp jump to 512 level）。CodeLlama-13B\n48\t    略高  （0.54）因 13B 参数量更有效利用 partial exception context；Qwen-1.5B 略低  （0.44）因小模型从 partial\n49\t    signal 中提取信息的效率较低。但差异幅度仅 0.10， 不足以形成 \"strong vs weak model\" 的分组叙事——所有模型的 transition\n50\t    形态  qualitatively 一致（gradual）。cross_model_std=2.23pp 说明模型间存在  absolute level 差异但\n51\t    transition 形态 homogeneous。tail-384 四模型均远高于  head-2048 (~79%, Δ≈6-9pp)，information\n52\t    locality 发现 robust。\n53\t\n54\t    '\n55\t  tables:\n56\t  - name: Budget Curve with tail-384 新数据点\n57\t    columns:\n58\t    - Model\n59\t    - tail-256\n60\t    - tail-384\n61\t    - tail-512\n62\t    - tail-1024\n63\t    - tail-2048\n64\t    - Δ(256→384)\n65\t    - Δ(384→512)\n66\t    - sharpness_index\n67\t    rows:\n68\t    - - Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B\n69\t      - 77.5%\n70\t      - 85.6%\n71\t      - 93.6%\n72\t      - 96.5%\n73\t      - 97.3%\n74\t      - +8.1pp\n75\t      - +8.0pp\n76\t      - 0.52\n77\t    - - DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B\n78\t      - 76.4%\n79\t      - 84.3%\n80\t      - 93.9%\n81\t      - 96.5%\n82\t      - 95.0%\n83\t      - +7.9pp\n84\t      - +9.6pp\n85\t      - 0.46\n86\t    - - Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B\n87\t      - 72.6%\n88\t      - 83.2%\n89\t      - 95.6%\n90\t      - 96.6%\n91\t      - 97.9%\n92\t      - +10.6pp\n93\t      - +12.4pp\n94\t      - 0.44\n95\t    - - CodeLlama-13B-Instruct\n96\t      - 77.9%\n97\t      - 88.3%\n98\t      - 97.5%\n99\t      - 98.2%\n100\t      - collapsed\n101\t      - +10.4pp\n102\t      - +9.2pp\n103\t      - 0.54\n104\t  - name: Sharpness index 汇总\n105\t    columns:\n106\t    - Metric\n107\t    - Value\n108\t    - Interpretation\n109\t    rows:\n110\t    - - Mean sharpness\n111\t      - 0.49\n112\t      - 几乎完美 midpoint → gradual transition\n113\t    - - Range\n114\t      - '[0.44, 0.54]'\n115\t      - 所有模型 within [0.35, 0.65] → 无 outlier\n116\t    - - Cross-model std\n117\t      - 2.23pp\n118\t      - moderate variation, within [2.0, 5.0]\n119\t    - - All > head-2048\n120\t      - Yes (Δ 4-9pp)\n121\t      - information locality confirmed\n122\t  figures_description:\n123\t  - 'Budget curve (overlay): x=tail token budget [256, 384, 512, 1024, 2048], y=accuracy\n124\t    (%)。4 条曲线 log-shaped，tail-384 点落在 256-512 连线的  中间位置（无 elbow），视觉上确认 smooth gradient。水平虚线标注  exception_only\n125\t    ceiling (99.83%)。灰色 band 标注 head-2048 range  (75-81%) 作为对照，突出 tail >> head 约 15pp。\n126\t\n127\t    '\n128\t  - 'Δ bar chart: 每个模型两个 bar（Δ256→384 vs Δ384→512），四组并排。 所有模型两个 Δ 相近（ratio 0.8-1.1），视觉确认\n129\t    gradual（若 sharp  则两个 bar 高度会差 >3x）。\n130\t\n131\t    '\n132\t  analysis: 'tail-384 数据明确排除 sharp phase transition 假说。四模型 sharpness  index 集中在 0.44-0.54（mean=0.49），指向\n133\t    transition 恰好在 midpoint  附近——信息是随 token budget 线性累积的，不存在 critical threshold。 关键影响：(1)\n134\t    Claim 2 措辞从 \"phase transition\" 改为 \"diminishing  returns with steepest gains in\n135\t    256-512 range\"；(2) budget curve 的  核心价值是展示 tail >> head（information locality），不是定位拐点；\n136\t    (3) 四模型形态一致（all gradual）简化了叙事——不需要 model-dependent  transition 的 caveat，可以统一说\n137\t    \"all models show consistent  log-shaped diminishing returns\"。这比 mixed sharp/gradual\n138\t    结果  更有利于论文叙事清晰度。budget curve 降为 supporting figure  （1/3 page），label_only 26/74\n139\t    分解保持 Claim 2 核心地位。\n140\t\n141\t    '\n142\t- name: cross_seed_budget_curve_tail512\n143\t  plan_id: plan_017\n144\t  description: tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds，验证 convergence band robustness\n145\t  expected_results:\n146\t    qwen7b:\n147\t      seed42: 0.936\n148\t      seed123: 0.919\n149\t      seed456: 0.947\n150\t      mean: 0.934\n151\t      std_pp: 1.41\n152\t    deepseek:\n153\t      seed42: 0.939\n154\t      seed123: 0.892\n155\t      seed456: 0.935\n156\t      mean: 0.922\n157\t      std_pp: 2.63\n158\t    qwen15b:\n159\t      seed42: 0.956\n160\t      seed123: 0.932\n161\t      seed456: 0.949\n162\t      mean: 0.946\n163\t      std_pp: 1.24\n164\t    codellama13b:\n165\t      seed42: 0.975\n166\t      seed123: 0.958\n167\t      seed456: 0.971\n168\t      mean: 0.968\n169\t      std_pp: 0.89\n170\t    cross_model_avg_std_pp: 1.54\n171\t    worst_seed_still_above_head2048: true\n172\t    rank_ordering_preserved_all_seeds: true\n173\t  result_rationale: 'median 档定义 cross-seed variance σ 1-3pp at tail-512，noise 不否定趋势但\n174\t    削弱 point estimate 精度。tail-512 位于 budget curve 的 steep gain 段终点， LoRA 初始化对此 regime\n175\t    的影响比 plateau 段（1024/2048）更大。DeepSeek 方差  最高（σ≈2.6pp），与已知 LoRA sensitivity 一致——exception_only\n176\t    上 DeepSeek  σ=4.8pp（seed123 outlier 91.09%），tail-512 输入更复杂（包含非 exception 的  Tier\n177\t    2 noise tokens），seed123 的 LoRA 初始化弱点在噪声更多的 input 下被放大。 但 DeepSeek seed123 的 89.2%\n178\t    仍远高于 head-2048（~79%），information locality  结论不受影响。Qwen-7B σ=1.4pp，高于 exception_only\n179\t    的 0pp，因为 tail-512  包含更多需要学习的 non-trivial mapping（loop fragments 等），training  stochasticity\n180\t    有更大 impact。CodeLlama-13B σ 最小（0.9pp），13B 参数量  提供最平滑的 LoRA landscape。Qwen-1.5B\n181\t    σ=1.2pp，比预期低——可能因 1.5B  模型的 LoRA 虽然 rugged 但 capacity 限制使得所有 seed 都收敛到 similar  capacity-bounded\n182\t    solution。关键：rank ordering（CodeLlama > Qwen-1.5B >  Qwen-7B > DeepSeek）在所有 3 seeds\n183\t    上保持一致，trend robust。\n184\t\n185\t    '\n186\t  tables:\n187\t  - name: Cross-seed tail-512 Robustness (3 seeds × 4 models)\n188\t    columns:\n189\t    - Model\n190\t    - Seed42\n191\t    - Seed123\n192\t    - Seed456\n193\t    - Mean\n194\t    - Std\n195\t    - Min-Max Band\n196\t    - Min > head-2048?\n197\t    rows:\n198\t    - - Qwen-7B\n199\t      - 93.6%\n200\t      - 91.9%\n201\t      - 94.7%\n202\t      - 93.4%\n203\t      - 1.4pp\n204\t      - 2.8pp\n205\t      - Yes (91.9>81.0)\n206\t    - - DeepSeek-6.7B\n207\t      - 93.9%\n208\t      - 89.2%\n209\t      - 93.5%\n210\t      - 92.2%\n211\t      - 2.6pp\n212\t      - 4.7pp\n213\t      - Yes (89.2>79.2)\n214\t    - - Qwen-1.5B\n215\t      - 95.6%\n216\t      - 93.2%\n217\t      - 94.9%\n218\t      - 94.6%\n219\t      - 1.2pp\n220\t      - 2.4pp\n221\t      - Yes (93.2>75.3)\n222\t    - - CodeLlama-13B\n223\t      - 97.5%\n224\t      - 95.8%\n225\t      - 97.1%\n226\t      - 96.8%\n227\t      - 0.9pp\n228\t      - 1.7pp\n229\t      - Yes (95.8>79.9)\n230\t  - name: Convergence band vs model capability\n231\t    columns:\n232\t    - Group\n233\t    - Models\n234\t    - Avg_Std\n235\t    - Interpretation\n236\t    rows:\n237\t    - - Lower variance\n238\t      - Qwen-1.5B, CodeLlama-13B\n239\t      - 1.1pp\n240\t      - Capacity extremes (very small/very large) → deterministic convergence\n241\t    - - Higher variance\n242\t      - Qwen-7B, DeepSeek-6.7B\n243\t      - 2.0pp\n244\t      - Mid-scale models with more complex LoRA landscapes\n245\t  figures_description:\n246\t  - 'Budget curve with error bands: 4 models × 5 budget points (256-2048)， tail-512\n247\t    处添加 3-seed error bar (mean ± 1σ)。即使最宽 error bar  (DeepSeek ±2.6pp)，tail-512 下界\n248\t    (89.2%) 仍远高于 head-2048 上界  (~81%)，visual confirmation of information locality\n249\t    robustness。\n250\t\n251\t    '\n252\t  analysis: 'cross-seed 数据确认：(1) tail >> head 趋势在所有 seeds 上稳健—— worst-case tail-512\n253\t    (DeepSeek seed123=89.2%) 仍比 best-case head-2048  (~81%) 高 8pp；(2) point estimate\n254\t    精度有限，单 seed 结果应附 ±2pp  uncertainty；(3) rank ordering 完全 preserved（所有 3 seeds 上  CodeLlama\n255\t    > Qwen-1.5B > Qwen-7B ≈ DeepSeek），model capability  对 absolute level 的影响 consistent。对论文的操作建议：budget\n256\t    curve  figure 中为 tail-512 标注 3-seed error bar，caption 注明 \"typical  σ ≈ 1-3pp across\n257\t    models\"。不需要报告 all 12 individual numbers  in main text——mean ± std 足够。审稿人问 \"single\n258\t    seed?\" 时可指向  appendix full table。24 GPU-hours 投入较大，但回应审稿人的  single-seed concern\n259\t    是高优先级需求，值得。\n260\t\n261\t    '\n262\t- name: error_analysis_failure_modes\n263\t  plan_id: plan_018\n264\t  description: 用已有 predictions.jsonl 分析各条件 failure modes 差异\n265\t  expected_results:\n266\t    exception_only_errors: 2\n267\t    exception_only_categories:\n268\t      GeneratorExit_irreducible: 2\n269\t    exception_only_direction: 100% pass→fail FN\n270\t    vota_errors: 7\n271\t    vota_overlap_with_exception: 2\n272\t    vota_unique_errors: 5\n273\t    vota_dominant_pattern: 'Tier 2 noise: loop artifact (3) + attention dilution (2)'\n274\t    full_trace_errors: 217\n275\t    full_trace_overlap_with_no_trace_pct: 0.63\n276\t    full_trace_unique_errors_pct: 0.37\n277\t    full_trace_length_error_correlation_r: 0.41\n278\t    full_trace_long_trace_error_rate: 0.33\n279\t    full_trace_short_trace_error_rate: 0.09\n280\t    no_trace_errors: 296\n281\t    no_trace_dominant_pattern: majority class bias + code complexity correlation\n282\t    loop_only_errors: 171\n283\t    tier1_tier2_error_jaccard: 0.01\n284\t    cross_model_irreducible_overlap_jaccard: 0.85\n285\t  result_rationale: 'Error analysis 在 median 档下揭示条件间 qualitatively different failure\n286\t    modes， 为现有 claims 提供 supporting evidence 但不产生新发现。推理链：\n287\t\n288\t    (1) exception_only 的 2 个 error (id=901, 905) 已被完全解释——GeneratorExit 是  Python all()\n289\t    短路的 BaseException，tracer 统一标 [ERROR]。模型看到 7 行  [ERROR] GeneratorExit 合理预测 fail。这是\n290\t    representation-inherent error， 非模型不足。跨 Qwen 3 seeds 完全重合确认是 data property。\n291\t\n292\t    (2) VOTA 额外 5 个 error 源自 Tier 2 noise：3 例中 loop compression 产生  正常行为摘要但同时存在 exception（矛盾信号让模型犹豫，confidence\n293\t    下降）； 2 例中 Tier 2 tokens 稀释了对 exception 的 attention（输入更长，exception  信号占比更低）。这直接\n294\t    quantify \"combining tiers introduces noise\" (Claim 3)。\n295\t\n296\t    (3) full_trace 的 217 个 error 中 ~63% 也是 no_trace 的错误——这些是  intrinsically hard cases，trace\n297\t    未提供 accessible 的额外信号（signal  buried in thousands of tokens）。剩余 37% 是 full_trace\n298\t    unique errors—— trace 信息 actively misleading（长 trace 中的 intermediate exception  被\n299\t    caught 但 trace 仍包含 [ERROR]，模型误判）或 attention 被长 context  分散。error rate 与 trace\n300\t    length 正相关 (r≈0.41)：>1500 tokens 的 trace  error rate ~33% vs <500 tokens ~9%，information\n301\t    overload 的 dose-response。\n302\t\n303\t    (4) Tier 1 和 Tier 2 的 error sets 几乎不重叠 (Jaccard=0.01)：Tier 1  fails 在 representation\n304\t    ambiguity (GeneratorExit)，Tier 2 fails 在  reasoning complexity (loop behavior\n305\t    interpretation)。\n306\t\n307\t    '\n308\t  tables:\n309\t  - name: Error mode distribution by condition (Qwen-7B seed42)\n310\t    columns:\n311\t    - Condition\n312\t    - Total Errors\n313\t    - Error Rate\n314\t    - fail→pass (%)\n315\t    - pass→fail (%)\n316\t    - Dominant Failure Mode\n317\t    rows:\n318\t    - - exception_only\n319\t      - 2\n320\t      - 0.17%\n321\t      - 0%\n322\t      - 100%\n323\t      - GeneratorExit irreducible\n324\t    - - ae_only\n325\t      - 1\n326\t      - 0.08%\n327\t      - 0%\n328\t      - 100%\n329\t      - GeneratorExit variant\n330\t    - - VOTA\n331\t      - 7\n332\t      - 0.59%\n333\t      - 57%\n334\t      - 43%\n335\t      - Tier 2 noise conflict\n336\t    - - loop_only\n337\t      - 171\n338\t      - 14.4%\n339\t      - 36%\n340\t      - 64%\n341\t      - Insufficient diagnostic signal\n342\t    - - full_trace\n343\t      - 217\n344\t      - 18.2%\n345\t      - 47%\n346\t      - 53%\n347\t      - Information overload (length-correlated)\n348\t    - - label_only\n349\t      - 164\n350\t      - 13.8%\n351\t      - 65%\n352\t      - 35%\n353\t      - Gradient dilution residual\n354\t    - - no_trace\n355\t      - 296\n356\t      - 24.9%\n357\t      - 70%\n358\t      - 30%\n359\t      - Majority class bias\n360\t  - name: Error rate by trace length bucket (full_trace)\n361\t    columns:\n362\t    - Length_Bucket\n363\t    - N_Samples\n364\t    - Errors\n365\t    - Error_Rate\n366\t    rows:\n367\t    - - <500 tok\n368\t      - ~190\n369\t      - ~17\n370\t      - ~9%\n371\t    - - 500-1000 tok\n372\t      - ~340\n373\t      - ~54\n374\t      - ~16%\n375\t    - - 1000-1500 tok\n376\t      - ~370\n377\t      - ~72\n378\t      - ~19%\n379\t    - - '>1500 tok'\n380\t      - ~290\n381\t      - ~96\n382\t      - ~33%\n383\t  - name: Cross-condition error overlap (Jaccard, Qwen-7B)\n384\t    columns:\n385\t    - Pair\n386\t    - Jaccard\n387\t    - Shared_Errors\n388\t    - Interpretation\n389\t    rows:\n390\t    - - exception_only ∩ VOTA\n391\t      - 0.29\n392\t      - 2\n393\t      - VOTA superset includes Tier 1 irreducible\n394\t    - - full_trace ∩ no_trace\n395\t      - 0.36\n396\t      - 137\n397\t      - 63% of full_trace errors also in no_trace\n398\t    - - loop_only ∩ label_only\n399\t      - 0.4\n400\t      - 95\n401\t      - 'Similar difficulty: trace-as-context conditions'\n402\t    - - Tier 1 ∩ Tier 2 errors\n403\t      - 0.01\n404\t      - 0\n405\t      - Qualitatively different failure modes\n406\t  figures_description:\n407\t  - 'Error rate vs trace length scatter (full_trace): x=input token count,  y=binary\n408\t    correct/incorrect, with binned trend line. Shows dose-response  of information\n409\t    overload. Pearson r≈0.41 annotated.\n410\t\n411\t    '\n412\t  - 'Venn diagram: exception_only (2 errors) vs VOTA (7 errors).  Overlap = 2 (GeneratorExit).\n413\t    5 unique VOTA errors labeled by  root cause category. Visually demonstrates Tier\n414\t    2 noise.\n415\t\n416\t    '\n417\t  analysis: 'Error analysis 为 3 个 Claims 提供 converging evidence：(1) exception_only  的\n418\t    irreducible 2/1190 errors 跨模型重叠（Jaccard 0.85）确认是 data/ representation property（Claim\n419\t    1 \"ceiling\" 论点）；(2) full_trace  error-length correlation r=0.41 是 information\n420\t    overload 的 direct  evidence（Claim 2）；(3) VOTA 的 5 个 Tier 2-attributable errors  quantify\n421\t    \"noise from combining tiers\"（Claim 3）。在 median 档下  这些发现 expected 但 useful——审稿人会\n422\t    appreciate 对 error 的  systematic analysis，但不会视为 independent contribution。建议作为  Appendix\n423\t    B（~1 page: 1 table + 2 case studies + correlation plot）， main text 中引用关键数字（\"full_trace\n424\t    error rate correlates with  trace length, r=0.41, confirming information overload\n425\t    hypothesis\"）。 0 GPU-hours，纯分析，ROI 极高。\n426\t\n427\t    '\n428\t- name: cross_model_calibration_exception_only\n429\t  plan_id: plan_019\n430\t  description: 4 models × exception_only ECE/Brier 对比\n431\t  expected_results:\n432\t    qwen7b:\n433\t      accuracy: 0.9983\n434\t      ece: 0.0027\n435\t      brier: 0.0013\n436\t      mce: 0.835\n437\t    deepseek_seed42:\n438\t      accuracy: 0.9933\n439\t      ece: 0.012\n440\t      brier: 0.006\n441\t      mce: 0.45\n442\t    qwen15b:\n443\t      accuracy: 0.9983\n444\t      ece: 0.005\n445\t      brier: 0.003\n446\t      mce: 0.62\n447\t    codellama13b:\n448\t      accuracy: 0.9983\n449\t      ece: 0.003\n450\t      brier: 0.002\n451\t      mce: 0.75\n452\t    all_nonoutlier_ece_below: 0.015\n453\t    ece_range:\n454\t    - 0.0027\n455\t    - 0.012\n456\t    ece_ratio_vs_notrace_range:\n457\t    - 14\n458\t    - 63\n459\t  result_rationale: 'Calibration 直接跟随 accuracy 和 error 数量。三个 99.83% 模型（Qwen-7B,  Qwen-1.5B,\n460\t    CodeLlama-13B）仅有 2 个相同 error（GeneratorExit），calibration  差异仅来自 confidence distribution\n461\t    的模型间差异：\n462\t\n463\t    Qwen-7B (ECE=0.0027, 已有数据): 基准。2 个 misclassified samples 的  confidence 贡献几乎全部\n464\t    ECE。\n465\t\n466\t    CodeLlama-13B (ECE≈0.003): 13B 参数量产生更 peaked softmax distribution， correct predictions\n467\t    的 confidence 更接近 1.0。2 个 error 的 confidence  也偏高（模型更 \"确定\"），但 overall 因 correct\n468\t    predictions 的 near-perfect  calibration 而 ECE 极低。略高于 Qwen-7B 因为 CodeLlama 的 chat\n469\t    template  与训练数据的 alignment 略有差异。\n470\t\n471\t    Qwen-1.5B (ECE≈0.005): 同 Qwen tokenizer，same 2 errors。但 1.5B 模型的  softmax entropy\n472\t    更高（small model less confident），correct predictions  的 mean confidence 可能在 ~0.95\n473\t    而非 ~0.99，造成 systematic slight  under-confidence → ECE 略高。\n474\t\n475\t    DeepSeek seed42 (ECE≈0.012): 8 个 errors（vs others 的 2 个），4× 更多  misclassified\n476\t    bins 贡献 ECE。其中部分 fail samples 被高 confidence 预测为  pass（LoRA 训练不完全映射 exception→fail），这些\n477\t    high-confidence wrong  predictions 是 ECE 的主要 contributor。但 0.012 仍远低于 no_trace\n478\t    的 0.171  （14× improvement）。\n479\t\n480\t    总体：所有模型 ECE < 0.015，exception signal 的 calibration 优势跨模型  robust。magnitude 差异主要由\n481\t    error count 驱动，非 signal quality 差异。\n482\t\n483\t    '\n484\t  tables:\n485\t  - name: Cross-model calibration for exception_only\n486\t    columns:\n487\t    - Model\n488\t    - Accuracy\n489\t    - ECE\n490\t    - Brier\n491\t    - ECE ratio vs no_trace (0.171)\n492\t    rows:\n493\t    - - Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B\n494\t      - 99.83%\n495\t      - 0.0027\n496\t      - 0.0013\n497\t      - 63×\n498\t    - - CodeLlama-13B-Instruct\n499\t      - 99.83%\n500\t      - 0.003\n501\t      - 0.002\n502\t      - 57×\n503\t    - - Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B\n504\t      - 99.83%\n505\t      - 0.005\n506\t      - 0.003\n507\t      - 34×\n508\t    - - DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B\n509\t      - 99.33%\n510\t      - 0.012\n511\t      - 0.006\n512\t      - 14×\n513\t  figures_description:\n514\t  - 'Reliability diagram (2×2 grid): 每模型一 panel，predicted probability  vs observed\n515\t    frequency。三个 99.83% 模型的 curves 紧贴 diagonal， DeepSeek 的 curve 在 0.8-0.95 bin 略偏（overconfident\n516\t    on some  misclassified samples）。\n517\t\n518\t    '\n519\t  - 'ECE comparison bar chart: 4 models × exception_only，with Qwen-7B  的 no_trace/full_trace/VOTA\n520\t    ECE 作参考线。所有 exception_only bars  极短（≤0.012），no_trace reference line (0.171) 显著高。\n521\t\n522\t    '\n523\t  analysis: 'Cross-model calibration 证实 exception signal 的 calibration 优势  不限于 Qwen-7B——所有\n524\t    4 模型 ECE ≤ 0.012，与 no_trace ECE 0.171  相比 14-63× improvement。论文可 claim \"exception_only\n525\t    achieves  near-perfect calibration (ECE ≤ 0.012) across all tested models,  regardless\n526\t    of architecture and scale\"。这是独立于 accuracy 的  evidence dimension：即使审稿人质疑 99.83%\n527\t    是 saturation，ECE/Brier  数据证明模型 \"knows what it knows\"——confidence 与 correctness  高度一致。DeepSeek\n528\t    的略高 ECE (0.012) 与其更多 errors (8 vs 2)  一致，不 undermine overall finding。建议作为 main\n529\t    text Table  （与 accuracy table 并列或合并为一张大表），1 GPU-hour  investment，cost-effective。\n530\t\n531\t    '\n532\t- name: few_shot_frontier_baseline\n533\t  plan_id: plan_020\n534\t  description: GPT-4o/Claude 0-shot + 3-shot verdict prediction baseline\n535\t  expected_results:\n536\t    gpt4o_0shot_exception: 0.952\n537\t    gpt4o_0shot_exception_ci:\n538\t    - 0.937\n539\t    - 0.965\n540\t    gpt4o_3shot_exception: 0.966\n541\t    gpt4o_3shot_exception_ci:\n542\t    - 0.953\n543\t    - 0.977\n544\t    claude_0shot_exception: 0.958\n545\t    claude_0shot_exception_ci:\n546\t    - 0.944\n547\t    - 0.971\n548\t    claude_3shot_exception: 0.972\n549\t    claude_3shot_exception_ci:\n550\t    - 0.959\n551\t    - 0.982\n552\t    gpt4o_0shot_no_trace: 0.805\n553\t    claude_0shot_no_trace: 0.821\n554\t    sft_qwen7b_exception_only: 0.9983\n555\t    sft_advantage_vs_best_frontier_pp: 2.6\n556\t    sft_qwen15b_advantage_vs_gpt4o_pp: 2.6\n557\t    api_cost_total_usd: 18\n558\t    sft_inference_cost_usd: 0.01\n559\t  result_rationale: 'Frontier models 的 exception_only 0-shot 能达 95-96% 因为 task 在  exception_only\n560\t    格式下高度 interpretable：有 [ERROR] → fail，无 [ERROR] →  pass。已有 local model zero-shot\n561\t    数据（Qwen-1.5B 93.45%, DeepSeek 90.59%） 证明不需要 SFT 就能达到 ~90%+。Frontier models 更强的\n562\t    instruction following  + 更广的 code knowledge 在此基础上再提升 ~3-5pp：\n563\t\n564\t    (1) GPT-4o 0-shot 95.2%：比 local Qwen-1.5B zero-shot (93.45%) 仅高 1.8pp ——exception\n565\t    task 对 model scale 的 marginal return 很低（进一步证明是  signal-limited not capacity-limited）。剩余\n566\t    4.8% error 来自：GeneratorExit  等 non-fatal exceptions（同 SFT 模型）、format marker 的不一致解读、\n567\t    边缘 case 的 conservative \"fail\" 偏好。\n568\t\n569\t    (2) 3-shot 额外 +1.4-1.4pp：exemplars 帮助建立 consistent decision  boundary，特别是处理 [No\n570\t    exception data in trace] marker 的一致性。 但 3 个 exemplars 无法覆盖 exception type 的 long-tail\n571\t    distribution。\n572\t\n573\t    (3) SFT Qwen-7B (99.83%) 仍高于 best frontier 3-shot (Claude 97.2%)  2.6pp。虽然 pp\n574\t    gap 不大，但 error count 差异显著：2 vs ~33 errors， 16.5× fewer mistakes。且 SFT inference\n575\t    cost 是 frontier API 的 ~1/1800。\n576\t\n577\t    (4) Frontier no_trace (80-82%) >> SFT no_trace (75.1%)：frontier model  的 code\n578\t    reasoning 能力可部分替代 trace 信息，但仍远低于 SFT +  exception_only (99.83%)——exception signal\n579\t    + SFT 的组合效果不可被  单纯 model scale 替代。\n580\t\n581\t    '\n582\t  tables:\n583\t  - name: SFT vs frontier few-shot comparison\n584\t    columns:\n585\t    - Method\n586\t    - Model\n587\t    - Input\n588\t    - Shots\n589\t    - Accuracy\n590\t    - Errors/1190\n591\t    - Approx Cost\n592\t    rows:\n593\t    - - SFT\n594\t      - Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B\n595\t      - exception_only\n596\t      - —\n597\t      - 99.83%\n598\t      - 2\n599\t      - $0.01\n600\t    - - SFT\n601\t      - Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B\n602\t      - exception_only\n603\t      - —\n604\t      - 99.83%\n605\t      - 2\n606\t      - $0.005\n607\t    - - SFT\n608\t      - CodeLlama-13B\n609\t      - exception_only\n610\t      - —\n611\t      - 99.83%\n612\t      - 2\n613\t      - $0.02\n614\t    - - Few-shot\n615\t      - GPT-4o\n616\t      - exception_only\n617\t      - 3\n618\t      - 96.6%\n619\t      - ~40\n620\t      - $8\n621\t    - - Few-shot\n622\t      - Claude-3.5\n623\t      - exception_only\n624\t      - 3\n625\t      - 97.2%\n626\t      - ~33\n627\t      - $10\n628\t    - - Few-shot\n629\t      - GPT-4o\n630\t      - exception_only\n631\t      - 0\n632\t      - 95.2%\n633\t      - ~57\n634\t      - $5\n635\t    - - Few-shot\n636\t      - Claude-3.5\n637\t      - exception_only\n638\t      - 0\n639\t      - 95.8%\n640\t      - ~50\n641\t      - $7\n642\t    - - Few-shot\n643\t      - GPT-4o\n644\t      - no_trace\n645\t      - 0\n646\t      - 80.5%\n647\t      - ~232\n648\t      - $3\n649\t    - - Few-shot\n650\t      - Claude-3.5\n651\t      - no_trace\n652\t      - 0\n653\t      - 82.1%\n654\t      - ~213\n655\t      - $5\n656\t    - - SFT\n657\t      - Qwen-7B\n658\t      - no_trace\n659\t      - —\n660\t      - 75.1%\n661\t      - 296\n662\t      - $0.01\n663\t  - name: Error count perspective (补充审稿人 'gap only 2-3pp' 的 concern)\n664\t    columns:\n665\t    - Model\n666\t    - Accuracy\n667\t    - Errors\n668\t    - Error Reduction vs frontier best\n669\t    rows:\n670\t    - - SFT Qwen-7B exception_only\n671\t      - 99.83%\n672\t      - 2\n673\t      - baseline\n674\t    - - Claude 3-shot exception_only\n675\t      - 97.2%\n676\t      - ~33\n677\t      - 16.5× more errors\n678\t    - - GPT-4o 3-shot exception_only\n679\t      - 96.6%\n680\t      - ~40\n681\t      - 20× more errors\n682\t  figures_description:\n683\t  - 'Accuracy bar chart: SFT models (4 bars at 99.83%) vs frontier  few-shot (4 bars\n684\t    at 95-97%) vs frontier no_trace (2 bars at 80-82%). SFT advantage visually clear\n685\t    despite small pp gap — the ceiling  region (99%+) makes absolute difference look\n686\t    small but relative  error reduction is dramatic.\n687\t\n688\t    '\n689\t  - 'Cost-accuracy scatter: x=log10(cost in $), y=accuracy (%). SFT  points cluster\n690\t    in top-left (high accuracy, low cost), frontier  in bottom-right. Pareto frontier\n691\t    clearly dominated by SFT.\n692\t\n693\t    '\n694\t  analysis: 'Frontier baseline 在 median 档下提供 solid but not overwhelming  evidence：SFT\n695\t    beats frontier 3-shot by ~2.6pp (error count 16-20×  reduction)。这足以 claim \"task-specific\n696\t    SFT on 7B model surpasses  frontier few-shot\" 但审稿人可能视 2.6pp 为 modest。Rebuttal\n697\t    策略： (a) 强调 error count 而非 pp——\"from ~33 errors to 2 irreducible  errors\" 更有冲击力；(b)\n698\t    cost perspective——1800× cheaper；(c)  offline deployability。最有价值的发现：frontier models\n699\t    也从  exception traces 大幅获益 (no_trace→exception: +14-15pp)， independent confirm\n700\t    Claim 1/2。建议 main text 用 1 paragraph +  1 table 呈现，full results 放 appendix。0 GPU-hours，仅\n701\t    API  cost ~$18。如果 deadline 紧张可 deprioritize——核心 claims  不依赖此数据。\n702\t\n703\t    '\n704\t- name: ood_generalization_cross_language\n705\t  plan_id: plan_021\n706\t  description: 不同编程语言/项目的 trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性\n707\t  expected_results:\n708\t    python_ood_exception_only: 0.963\n709\t    python_ood_degradation_pp: -3.5\n710\t    java_exception_only: 0.918\n711\t    java_degradation_pp: -8.0\n712\t    javascript_exception_only: 0.902\n713\t    javascript_degradation_pp: -9.6\n714\t    cross_lang_mean: 0.928\n715\t    cross_lang_mean_degradation_pp: -7.0\n716\t    python_ood_no_trace: 0.715\n717\t    java_no_trace: 0.68\n718\t    javascript_no_trace: 0.665\n719\t    exception_lift_over_notrace_ood_mean_pp: 24.1\n720\t    ood_test_set_size_per_lang: 500\n721\t  result_rationale: 'OOD 泛化性取决于 exception signal 的 cross-language structural similarity。\n722\t    [ERROR] type: ... message: ... 格式是 tracer 的统一输出规范，但 exception  type 名称和 error\n723\t    message 惯例跨语言不同，造成 token-level distribution shift。\n724\t\n725\t    Python OOD (-3.5pp, 96.3%): 同语言不同项目，exception type 分布与训练集  高度重叠（TypeError, ValueError,\n726\t    IndexError 是 universal），仅 project-specific  custom exception classes 造成少量降级。测试集项目的\n727\t    test structure（pytest  fixtures、多文件 import）可能引入不同的 exception context，但 [ERROR]\n728\t    tag  的 binary signal 不受影响。\n729\t\n730\t    Java (-8.0pp, 91.8%): NullPointerException, ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException 等  Java-specific\n731\t    type names 训练集未出现——模型无法利用 type-level semantics， 退化到依赖 [ERROR] tag presence 的 binary\n732\t    heuristic。但 binary heuristic  本身在 Qwen-7B zero-shot 上已达 ~89%，SFT 的 fine-tuned\n733\t    decision boundary  在新 type names 上部分失效。\n734\t\n735\t    JavaScript (-9.6pp, 90.2%): 最大降级。JS 的 error handling 更独特（Promise  rejection →\n736\t    UnhandledPromiseRejection, async TypeError），且 error message  格式与 Python 差异最大。tracer\n737\t    对 JS 的 [ERROR] 标注可能不如 Python  consistent（implementation difference）。\n738\t\n739\t    关键：所有语言上 exception_only lift over no_trace ≈ 24pp（与 in-domain  24.7pp 几乎相同），证明\n740\t    exception signal 的 fault detection mechanism  跨语言 transferable。Absolute degradation\n741\t    来自 token vocabulary shift  而非 mechanism failure。\n742\t\n743\t    '\n744\t  tables:\n745\t  - name: In-distribution vs OOD accuracy by language\n746\t    columns:\n747\t    - Language\n748\t    - Setting\n749\t    - exception_only\n750\t    - no_trace\n751\t    - Lift\n752\t    - Degradation vs ID\n753\t    rows:\n754\t    - - Python\n755\t      - ID (HumanEval+MBPP)\n756\t      - 99.83%\n757\t      - 75.1%\n758\t      - +24.7pp\n759\t      - baseline\n760\t    - - Python\n761\t      - OOD (new projects)\n762\t      - 96.3%\n763\t      - 71.5%\n764\t      - +24.8pp\n765\t      - -3.5pp\n766\t    - - Java\n767\t      - OOD\n768\t      - 91.8%\n769\t      - 68.0%\n770\t      - +23.8pp\n771\t      - -8.0pp\n772\t    - - JavaScript\n773\t      - OOD\n774\t      - 90.2%\n775\t      - 66.5%\n776\t      - +23.7pp\n777\t      - -9.6pp\n778\t  figures_description:\n779\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: 4 language settings × 2 conditions (exception_only  vs no_trace)。exception_only\n780\t    lift (~24pp) 在所有 settings 上几乎  constant，即使 absolute accuracy drops。Visual emphasis\n781\t    on preserved  lift rather than absolute degradation.\n782\t\n783\t    '\n784\t  analysis: 'OOD 实验在 median 档下是最大 risk/reward 投资。如果完成，可 claim  \"exception signal advantage\n785\t    transfers across languages with preserved  lift (~24pp) despite moderate absolute\n786\t    degradation (7pp mean)\"—— 部分回应 single-task scope criticism。但 risk factors：(1)\n787\t    需要  构建 3 个语言的 OOD 数据集（trace 生成 + 人工验证），timeline  紧张；(2) tracer 对 Java/JS 的 implementation\n788\t    可能有 quality  issues，影响实验可控性；(3) 如果某语言降到 <85%，审稿人可能  反向 argue \"not robust enough\"。在\n789\t    ARR May 25 deadline (7天后)  前几乎不可能完成——建议 deprioritize，标注为 camera-ready  supplement\n790\t    或 future work。如果有余力，优先做 Python OOD  （无需新 tracer，仅需新测试集），~4 GPU-hours 即可。\n791\t\n792\t    '\n793\t- name: training_dynamics_learning_curves\n794\t  plan_id: plan_022\n795\t  description: exception_only vs full_trace 的 learning curve（每 ~50 steps eval）\n796\t  expected_results:\n797\t    exception_only_frac_to_90pct: 0.05\n798\t    exception_only_frac_to_95pct: 0.08\n799\t    exception_only_frac_to_99pct: 0.2\n800\t    exception_only_curve_shape: monotonic_rapid_saturation\n801\t    vota_frac_to_90pct: 0.1\n802\t    vota_frac_to_95pct: 0.15\n803\t    vota_frac_to_99pct: 0.3\n804\t    vota_curve_shape: monotonic_moderate_saturation\n805\t    full_trace_frac_to_80pct: 0.3\n806\t    full_trace_peak:\n807\t      accuracy: 0.83\n808\t      epoch: 1\n809\t    full_trace_final: 0.8176\n810\t    full_trace_curve_shape: non_monotonic_epoch2_dip\n811\t    no_trace_plateau_frac: 0.15\n812\t    no_trace_plateau_accuracy: 0.751\n813\t    no_trace_curve_shape: rapid_plateau_low_ceiling\n814\t    convergence_ratio_exception_vs_vota: 1.9\n815\t    convergence_ratio_exception_vs_fulltrace: 3.8\n816\t    learning_efficiency_exception_samples_per_pp: 9.2\n817\t    learning_efficiency_fulltrace_samples_per_pp: 68.5\n818\t    efficiency_ratio: 7.4\n819\t  result_rationale: 'Training dynamics 直接测量 information density 对 learning efficiency\n820\t    的  影响。所有数值表示为 training fraction（0=start, 1.0=end of 3 epochs）， 因 absolute step\n821\t    count 取决于 batch size 等 hyperparameters。\n822\t\n823\t    exception_only 收敛最快（~5% training 达 90%, ~8% 达 95%）：input 极短  （mean <100 tokens），gradient\n824\t    完全集中在 verdict signal 上；effective  unique 样本仅 2858，但 binary structure（有 exception→fail,\n825\t    无→pass） 极其 learnable。已有 epoch-level 数据佐证：Qwen-7B exception_only 3  seeds 均在 epoch1\n826\t    结束时已达 99.83%（之后 epochs 无提升）——暗示  实际在 epoch1 早期就已收敛。\n827\t\n828\t    full_trace 收敛最慢且 non-monotonic：已有 epoch-level 数据  （epoch1=83.03%, epoch2=76.30%,\n829\t    epoch3=81.76%）展示 epoch2 坍塌。 中间 eval 应能捕获更 fine-grained 的 oscillation pattern。峰值在  ~30%\n830\t    training（epoch1 中后段），之后 overfitting 到 trace patterns  而非 verdict signal 导致 epoch2\n831\t    下降。epoch3 partial recovery 可能  是 random fluctuation。\n832\t\n833\t    VOTA 介于两者之间：含 Tier 1 (fast learning) + Tier 2 (slow learning)  信号，combined curve\n834\t    的前段被 Tier 1 驱动（快速上升到 >95%），后段  Tier 2 贡献边际提升。已有 epoch-level (epoch1=99.33%, epoch2-3=99.41%)  确认\n835\t    epoch1 几乎完成所有学习。\n836\t\n837\t    no_trace 快速 plateau：无 trace signal 可学习，模型在 ~15% training  后耗尽 code→verdict 的弱\n838\t    statistical correlation，之后 flat。\n839\t\n840\t    Learning efficiency ratio: exception_only 每 pp 需 ~9.2 个 effective  training samples（2858\n841\t    unique / (99.83-75.13) pp），full_trace 需 ~68.5  （~5800 / (81.76-75.13) pp），7.4×\n842\t    差距直接 quantify information  density 的 learning advantage。\n843\t\n844\t    '\n845\t  tables:\n846\t  - name: Convergence milestones (fraction of total training)\n847\t    columns:\n848\t    - Condition\n849\t    - To 80%\n850\t    - To 90%\n851\t    - To 95%\n852\t    - To 99%\n853\t    - Final Accuracy\n854\t    - Curve Shape\n855\t    rows:\n856\t    - - exception_only\n857\t      - ~3%\n858\t      - ~5%\n859\t      - ~8%\n860\t      - ~20%\n861\t      - 99.83%\n862\t      - Rapid saturation\n863\t    - - VOTA\n864\t      - ~5%\n865\t      - ~10%\n866\t      - ~15%\n867\t      - ~30%\n868\t      - 99.41%\n869\t      - Moderate saturation\n870\t    - - full_trace\n871\t      - ~30%\n872\t      - never\n873\t      - never\n874\t      - never\n875\t      - 81.76%\n876\t      - Non-monotonic (epoch2 dip)\n877\t    - - loop_only\n878\t      - ~12%\n879\t      - never\n880\t      - never\n881\t      - never\n882\t      - 85.63%\n883\t      - Slow saturation\n884\t    - - no_trace\n885\t      - never\n886\t      - never\n887\t      - never\n888\t      - never\n889\t      - 75.13%\n890\t      - Low-ceiling plateau\n891\t  - name: Learning efficiency comparison\n892\t    columns:\n893\t    - Condition\n894\t    - Effective Unique Samples\n895\t    - Lift (pp)\n896\t    - Samples per pp\n897\t    - Efficiency (relative)\n898\t    rows:\n899\t    - - exception_only\n900\t      - 2858\n901\t      - 24.7\n902\t      - 9.2\n903\t      - 1.0× (ref)\n904\t    - - VOTA\n905\t      - ~5800\n906\t      - 24.3\n907\t      - 17.5\n908\t      - 0.53×\n909\t    - - full_trace\n910\t      - ~5800\n911\t      - 6.6\n912\t      - 72.1\n913\t      - 0.13×\n914\t    - - no_trace\n915\t      - ~5800\n916\t      - 3.6\n917\t      - 132.8\n918\t      - 0.07×\n919\t  figures_description:\n920\t  - 'Learning curve plot (main figure): x=training progress (fraction),  y=eval accuracy\n921\t    (%). 4+ curves, eval points every ~2-3% of training. exception_only (red solid)\n922\t    rockets up and saturates by ~10%,  VOTA (blue solid) follows ~2× slower. full_trace\n923\t    (green dashed)  shows non-monotonic pattern with epoch2 dip. no_trace (gray dotted)  flat\n924\t    at ~75%. Horizontal dashed line at 71.5% (majority baseline). Visual impact: exception_only\n925\t    learning curve is dramatically  steeper than all others.\n926\t\n927\t    '\n928\t  - 'Learning efficiency bar chart: samples-per-pp for each condition. exception_only\n929\t    (9.2) vs full_trace (72.1) = 7.4× gap. Direct  visualization of information density\n930\t    effect on learning.\n931\t\n932\t    '\n933\t  analysis: 'Training dynamics 为 Claim 2 提供 process-level evidence（补充已有  outcome-level\n934\t    evidence）。核心 finding：exception_only 不仅 final  accuracy 最高，learning efficiency\n935\t    也 7.4× higher——denser signal  → faster and better learning。full_trace 的 non-monotonic\n936\t    curve  （epoch2 dip from 83% to 76%）是 information overload 的 dynamic  manifestation：模型先学到\n937\t    some useful trace patterns (epoch1 peak)， 然后 overfits to noise (epoch2 collapse)，部分恢复\n938\t    (epoch3)。 这呼应 D1 (eval_loss vs accuracy decoupling)。\n939\t\n940\t    审稿人可能 challenge: \"faster convergence is trivially expected  for shorter sequences\"。Rebuttal:\n941\t    shorter sequences + diagnostic  signal concentration 共同作用——loop_only 的 sequence\n942\t    长度与  full_trace 相当但 efficiency 5× higher (因 loop 信号 denser than  raw trace)，证明不只是\n943\t    length effect。\n944\t\n945\t    建议作为 Figure in main text（visual impact 强）但不升为  standalone claim。需修改 train_sft.py\n946\t    添加 intermediate eval  callback，8 GPU-hours。如果 deadline 紧张，可引用现有  epoch-level 数据（epoch1\n947\t    vs epoch3）作为 coarse-grained proxy  代替 fine-grained learning curve。'\n948\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c099d2b8-39c3-483a-a490-b8b2371065b9","uuid":"207fc2e2-75e6-4079-9d90-5f50955122d9","timestamp":"2026-05-18T14:00:18.560Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T125926/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 2 从 ''phase transition in trace informativeness'' 改为 ''diagnostic\n  signal concentrates in trace tail with diminishing returns; information density\n  — not gradient dilution — is the primary bottleneck''。tail-384 在四模型上均落在 256→512\n  的 43-53% 位置（83-88%）， 确认 smooth gradient 而非 sharp boundary。Budget curve 四模型趋势一致（log-shaped  diminishing\n  returns），但无共同拐点——每个模型的 steepest gain 区间长度和位置略有不同。 Budget curve 从 standalone finding\n  降为 supporting figure，label_only 26/74 分解升为  Claim 2 sole quantitative evidence。补偿措施:\n  (a) tail-512≫head-2048（~94% vs ~79%,  Δ≈15pp）作为 information locality 的 strong evidence；(b)\n  exception_only scale invariance （1.5B=7B=13B=99.83%）提升至更高叙事位置；(c) cross-model calibration\n  (plan_019, 1h) +  error analysis (plan_018, 0h) 增加独立 evidence 维度。cross-seed σ~1-3pp\n  不否定趋势但 削弱 point estimate 精度，所有 budget curve 数字需附 uncertainty band。仍冲 Main， Findings\n  作 fallback。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: fine_grained_phase_transition_tail384\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: tail-384 × 4 models，精确定位 256→512 区间 transition 形态\n  expected_results:\n    qwen7b_tail384_accuracy: 0.856\n    qwen7b_tail384_ci:\n    - 0.835\n    - 0.877\n    qwen7b_sharpness_index: 0.52\n    deepseek_tail384_accuracy: 0.843\n    deepseek_tail384_ci:\n    - 0.821\n    - 0.865\n    deepseek_sharpness_index: 0.46\n    qwen15b_tail384_accuracy: 0.832\n    qwen15b_tail384_ci:\n    - 0.808\n    - 0.854\n    qwen15b_sharpness_index: 0.44\n    codellama13b_tail384_accuracy: 0.883\n    codellama13b_tail384_ci:\n    - 0.863\n    - 0.903\n    codellama13b_sharpness_index: 0.54\n    four_model_mean: 0.854\n    four_model_std_pp: 2.23\n    mean_sharpness_index: 0.49\n    all_models_gradual: true\n  result_rationale: 'median 档定义 tail-384 在多数模型上 83-89%，transition 为 smooth gradient。\n    推导逻辑：exception events 集中在 trace 末尾（crash point + stack trace）， tail-256 捕获 assertion\n    结果和 traceback 尾部但常截断中段 context；tail-384  额外覆盖约 128 tokens 的 traceback context（调用栈前几帧、变量快照），提供  incremental\n    而非 step-function 式的信息增益。四模型 sharpness index 均在  0.44-0.54 范围（center 0.49，几乎正好\n    midpoint），没有模型出现 <0.3（sharp  stay at 256 level）或 >0.7（sharp jump to 512 level）。CodeLlama-13B\n    略高  （0.54）因 13B 参数量更有效利用 partial exception context；Qwen-1.5B 略低  （0.44）因小模型从 partial\n    signal 中提取信息的效率较低。但差异幅度仅 0.10， 不足以形成 \"strong vs weak model\" 的分组叙事——所有模型的 transition\n    形态  qualitatively 一致（gradual）。cross_model_std=2.23pp 说明模型间存在  absolute level 差异但\n    transition 形态 homogeneous。tail-384 四模型均远高于  head-2048 (~79%, Δ≈6-9pp)，information\n    locality 发现 robust。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Budget Curve with tail-384 新数据点\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - tail-256\n    - tail-384\n    - tail-512\n    - tail-1024\n    - tail-2048\n    - Δ(256→384)\n    - Δ(384→512)\n    - sharpness_index\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B\n      - 77.5%\n      - 85.6%\n      - 93.6%\n      - 96.5%\n      - 97.3%\n      - +8.1pp\n      - +8.0pp\n      - 0.52\n    - - DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B\n      - 76.4%\n      - 84.3%\n      - 93.9%\n      - 96.5%\n      - 95.0%\n      - +7.9pp\n      - +9.6pp\n      - 0.46\n    - - Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B\n      - 72.6%\n      - 83.2%\n      - 95.6%\n      - 96.6%\n      - 97.9%\n      - +10.6pp\n      - +12.4pp\n      - 0.44\n    - - CodeLlama-13B-Instruct\n      - 77.9%\n      - 88.3%\n      - 97.5%\n      - 98.2%\n      - collapsed\n      - +10.4pp\n      - +9.2pp\n      - 0.54\n  - name: Sharpness index 汇总\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Value\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Mean sharpness\n      - 0.49\n      - 几乎完美 midpoint → gradual transition\n    - - Range\n      - '[0.44, 0.54]'\n      - 所有模型 within [0.35, 0.65] → 无 outlier\n    - - Cross-model std\n      - 2.23pp\n      - moderate variation, within [2.0, 5.0]\n    - - All > head-2048\n      - Yes (Δ 4-9pp)\n      - information locality confirmed\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Budget curve (overlay): x=tail token budget [256, 384, 512, 1024, 2048], y=accuracy\n    (%)。4 条曲线 log-shaped，tail-384 点落在 256-512 连线的  中间位置（无 elbow），视觉上确认 smooth gradient。水平虚线标注  exception_only\n    ceiling (99.83%)。灰色 band 标注 head-2048 range  (75-81%) 作为对照，突出 tail >> head 约 15pp。\n\n    '\n  - 'Δ bar chart: 每个模型两个 bar（Δ256→384 vs Δ384→512），四组并排。 所有模型两个 Δ 相近（ratio 0.8-1.1），视觉确认\n    gradual（若 sharp  则两个 bar 高度会差 >3x）。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'tail-384 数据明确排除 sharp phase transition 假说。四模型 sharpness  index 集中在 0.44-0.54（mean=0.49），指向\n    transition 恰好在 midpoint  附近——信息是随 token budget 线性累积的，不存在 critical threshold。 关键影响：(1)\n    Claim 2 措辞从 \"phase transition\" 改为 \"diminishing  returns with steepest gains in\n    256-512 range\"；(2) budget curve 的  核心价值是展示 tail >> head（information locality），不是定位拐点；\n    (3) 四模型形态一致（all gradual）简化了叙事——不需要 model-dependent  transition 的 caveat，可以统一说\n    \"all models show consistent  log-shaped diminishing returns\"。这比 mixed sharp/gradual\n    结果  更有利于论文叙事清晰度。budget curve 降为 supporting figure  （1/3 page），label_only 26/74\n    分解保持 Claim 2 核心地位。\n\n    '\n- name: cross_seed_budget_curve_tail512\n  plan_id: plan_017\n  description: tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds，验证 convergence band robustness\n  expected_results:\n    qwen7b:\n      seed42: 0.936\n      seed123: 0.919\n      seed456: 0.947\n      mean: 0.934\n      std_pp: 1.41\n    deepseek:\n      seed42: 0.939\n      seed123: 0.892\n      seed456: 0.935\n      mean: 0.922\n      std_pp: 2.63\n    qwen15b:\n      seed42: 0.956\n      seed123: 0.932\n      seed456: 0.949\n      mean: 0.946\n      std_pp: 1.24\n    codellama13b:\n      seed42: 0.975\n      seed123: 0.958\n      seed456: 0.971\n      mean: 0.968\n      std_pp: 0.89\n    cross_model_avg_std_pp: 1.54\n    worst_seed_still_above_head2048: true\n    rank_ordering_preserved_all_seeds: true\n  result_rationale: 'median 档定义 cross-seed variance σ 1-3pp at tail-512，noise 不否定趋势但\n    削弱 point estimate 精度。tail-512 位于 budget curve 的 steep gain 段终点， LoRA 初始化对此 regime\n    的影响比 plateau 段（1024/2048）更大。DeepSeek 方差  最高（σ≈2.6pp），与已知 LoRA sensitivity 一致——exception_only\n    上 DeepSeek  σ=4.8pp（seed123 outlier 91.09%），tail-512 输入更复杂（包含非 exception 的  Tier\n    2 noise tokens），seed123 的 LoRA 初始化弱点在噪声更多的 input 下被放大。 但 DeepSeek seed123 的 89.2%\n    仍远高于 head-2048（~79%），information locality  结论不受影响。Qwen-7B σ=1.4pp，高于 exception_only\n    的 0pp，因为 tail-512  包含更多需要学习的 non-trivial mapping（loop fragments 等），training  stochasticity\n    有更大 impact。CodeLlama-13B σ 最小（0.9pp），13B 参数量  提供最平滑的 LoRA landscape。Qwen-1.5B\n    σ=1.2pp，比预期低——可能因 1.5B  模型的 LoRA 虽然 rugged 但 capacity 限制使得所有 seed 都收敛到 similar  capacity-bounded\n    solution。关键：rank ordering（CodeLlama > Qwen-1.5B >  Qwen-7B > DeepSeek）在所有 3 seeds\n    上保持一致，trend robust。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cross-seed tail-512 Robustness (3 seeds × 4 models)\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Seed42\n    - Seed123\n    - Seed456\n    - Mean\n    - Std\n    - Min-Max Band\n    - Min > head-2048?\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-7B\n      - 93.6%\n      - 91.9%\n      - 94.7%\n      - 93.4%\n      - 1.4pp\n      - 2.8pp\n      - Yes (91.9>81.0)\n    - - DeepSeek-6.7B\n      - 93.9%\n      - 89.2%\n      - 93.5%\n      - 92.2%\n      - 2.6pp\n      - 4.7pp\n      - Yes (89.2>79.2)\n    - - Qwen-1.5B\n      - 95.6%\n      - 93.2%\n      - 94.9%\n      - 94.6%\n      - 1.2pp\n      - 2.4pp\n      - Yes (93.2>75.3)\n    - - CodeLlama-13B\n      - 97.5%\n      - 95.8%\n      - 97.1%\n      - 96.8%\n      - 0.9pp\n      - 1.7pp\n      - Yes (95.8>79.9)\n  - name: Convergence band vs model capability\n    columns:\n    - Group\n    - Models\n    - Avg_Std\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Lower variance\n      - Qwen-1.5B, CodeLlama-13B\n      - 1.1pp\n      - Capacity extremes (very small/very large) → deterministic convergence\n    - - Higher variance\n      - Qwen-7B, DeepSeek-6.7B\n      - 2.0pp\n      - Mid-scale models with more complex LoRA landscapes\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Budget curve with error bands: 4 models × 5 budget points (256-2048)， tail-512\n    处添加 3-seed error bar (mean ± 1σ)。即使最宽 error bar  (DeepSeek ±2.6pp)，tail-512 下界\n    (89.2%) 仍远高于 head-2048 上界  (~81%)，visual confirmation of information locality\n    robustness。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'cross-seed 数据确认：(1) tail >> head 趋势在所有 seeds 上稳健—— worst-case tail-512\n    (DeepSeek seed123=89.2%) 仍比 best-case head-2048  (~81%) 高 8pp；(2) point estimate\n    精度有限，单 seed 结果应附 ±2pp  uncertainty；(3) rank ordering 完全 preserved（所有 3 seeds 上  CodeLlama\n    > Qwen-1.5B > Qwen-7B ≈ DeepSeek），model capability  对 absolute level 的影响 consistent。对论文的操作建议：budget\n    curve  figure 中为 tail-512 标注 3-seed error bar，caption 注明 \"typical  σ ≈ 1-3pp across\n    models\"。不需要报告 all 12 individual numbers  in main text——mean ± std 足够。审稿人问 \"single\n    seed?\" 时可指向  appendix full table。24 GPU-hours 投入较大，但回应审稿人的  single-seed concern\n    是高优先级需求，值得。\n\n    '\n- name: error_analysis_failure_modes\n  plan_id: plan_018\n  description: 用已有 predictions.jsonl 分析各条件 failure modes 差异\n  expected_results:\n    exception_only_errors: 2\n    exception_only_categories:\n      GeneratorExit_irreducible: 2\n    exception_only_direction: 100% pass→fail FN\n    vota_errors: 7\n    vota_overlap_with_exception: 2\n    vota_unique_errors: 5\n    vota_dominant_pattern: 'Tier 2 noise: loop artifact (3) + attention dilution (2)'\n    full_trace_errors: 217\n    full_trace_overlap_with_no_trace_pct: 0.63\n    full_trace_unique_errors_pct: 0.37\n    full_trace_length_error_correlation_r: 0.41\n    full_trace_long_trace_error_rate: 0.33\n    full_trace_short_trace_error_rate: 0.09\n    no_trace_errors: 296\n    no_trace_dominant_pattern: majority class bias + code complexity correlation\n    loop_only_errors: 171\n    tier1_tier2_error_jaccard: 0.01\n    cross_model_irreducible_overlap_jaccard: 0.85\n  result_rationale: 'Error analysis 在 median 档下揭示条件间 qualitatively different failure\n    modes， 为现有 claims 提供 supporting evidence 但不产生新发现。推理链：\n\n    (1) exception_only 的 2 个 error (id=901, 905) 已被完全解释——GeneratorExit 是  Python all()\n    短路的 BaseException，tracer 统一标 [ERROR]。模型看到 7 行  [ERROR] GeneratorExit 合理预测 fail。这是\n    representation-inherent error， 非模型不足。跨 Qwen 3 seeds 完全重合确认是 data property。\n\n    (2) VOTA 额外 5 个 error 源自 Tier 2 noise：3 例中 loop compression 产生  正常行为摘要但同时存在 exception（矛盾信号让模型犹豫，confidence\n    下降）； 2 例中 Tier 2 tokens 稀释了对 exception 的 attention（输入更长，exception  信号占比更低）。这直接\n    quantify \"combining tiers introduces noise\" (Claim 3)。\n\n    (3) full_trace 的 217 个 error 中 ~63% 也是 no_trace 的错误——这些是  intrinsically hard cases，trace\n    未提供 accessible 的额外信号（signal  buried in thousands of tokens）。剩余 37% 是 full_trace\n    unique errors—— trace 信息 actively misleading（长 trace 中的 intermediate exception  被\n    caught 但 trace 仍包含 [ERROR]，模型误判）或 attention 被长 context  分散。error rate 与 trace\n    length 正相关 (r≈0.41)：>1500 tokens 的 trace  error rate ~33% vs <500 tokens ~9%，information\n    overload 的 dose-response。\n\n    (4) Tier 1 和 Tier 2 的 error sets 几乎不重叠 (Jaccard=0.01)：Tier 1  fails 在 representation\n    ambiguity (GeneratorExit)，Tier 2 fails 在  reasoning complexity (loop behavior\n    interpretation)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Error mode distribution by condition (Qwen-7B seed42)\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Total Errors\n    - Error Rate\n    - fail→pass (%)\n    - pass→fail (%)\n    - Dominant Failure Mode\n    rows:\n    - - exception_only\n      - 2\n      - 0.17%\n      - 0%\n      - 100%\n      - GeneratorExit irreducible\n    - - ae_only\n      - 1\n      - 0.08%\n      - 0%\n      - 100%\n      - GeneratorExit variant\n    - - VOTA\n      - 7\n      - 0.59%\n      - 57%\n      - 43%\n      - Tier 2 noise conflict\n    - - loop_only\n      - 171\n      - 14.4%\n      - 36%\n      - 64%\n      - Insufficient diagnostic signal\n    - - full_trace\n      - 217\n      - 18.2%\n      - 47%\n      - 53%\n      - Information overload (length-correlated)\n    - - label_only\n      - 164\n      - 13.8%\n      - 65%\n      - 35%\n      - Gradient dilution residual\n    - - no_trace\n      - 296\n      - 24.9%\n      - 70%\n      - 30%\n      - Majority class bias\n  - name: Error rate by trace length bucket (full_trace)\n    columns:\n    - Length_Bucket\n    - N_Samples\n    - Errors\n    - Error_Rate\n    rows:\n    - - <500 tok\n      - ~190\n      - ~17\n      - ~9%\n    - - 500-1000 tok\n      - ~340\n      - ~54\n      - ~16%\n    - - 1000-1500 tok\n      - ~370\n      - ~72\n      - ~19%\n    - - '>1500 tok'\n      - ~290\n      - ~96\n      - ~33%\n  - name: Cross-condition error overlap (Jaccard, Qwen-7B)\n    columns:\n    - Pair\n    - Jaccard\n    - Shared_Errors\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - exception_only ∩ VOTA\n      - 0.29\n      - 2\n      - VOTA superset includes Tier 1 irreducible\n    - - full_trace ∩ no_trace\n      - 0.36\n      - 137\n      - 63% of full_trace errors also in no_trace\n    - - loop_only ∩ label_only\n      - 0.4\n      - 95\n      - 'Similar difficulty: trace-as-context conditions'\n    - - Tier 1 ∩ Tier 2 errors\n      - 0.01\n      - 0\n      - Qualitatively different failure modes\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Error rate vs trace length scatter (full_trace): x=input token count,  y=binary\n    correct/incorrect, with binned trend line. Shows dose-response  of information\n    overload. Pearson r≈0.41 annotated.\n\n    '\n  - 'Venn diagram: exception_only (2 errors) vs VOTA (7 errors).  Overlap = 2 (GeneratorExit).\n    5 unique VOTA errors labeled by  root cause category. Visually demonstrates Tier\n    2 noise.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Error analysis 为 3 个 Claims 提供 converging evidence：(1) exception_only  的\n    irreducible 2/1190 errors 跨模型重叠（Jaccard 0.85）确认是 data/ representation property（Claim\n    1 \"ceiling\" 论点）；(2) full_trace  error-length correlation r=0.41 是 information\n    overload 的 direct  evidence（Claim 2）；(3) VOTA 的 5 个 Tier 2-attributable errors  quantify\n    \"noise from combining tiers\"（Claim 3）。在 median 档下  这些发现 expected 但 useful——审稿人会\n    appreciate 对 error 的  systematic analysis，但不会视为 independent contribution。建议作为  Appendix\n    B（~1 page: 1 table + 2 case studies + correlation plot）， main text 中引用关键数字（\"full_trace\n    error rate correlates with  trace length, r=0.41, confirming information overload\n    hypothesis\"）。 0 GPU-hours，纯分析，ROI 极高。\n\n    '\n- name: cross_model_calibration_exception_only\n  plan_id: plan_019\n  description: 4 models × exception_only ECE/Brier 对比\n  expected_results:\n    qwen7b:\n      accuracy: 0.9983\n      ece: 0.0027\n      brier: 0.0013\n      mce: 0.835\n    deepseek_seed42:\n      accuracy: 0.9933\n      ece: 0.012\n      brier: 0.006\n      mce: 0.45\n    qwen15b:\n      accuracy: 0.9983\n      ece: 0.005\n      brier: 0.003\n      mce: 0.62\n    codellama13b:\n      accuracy: 0.9983\n      ece: 0.003\n      brier: 0.002\n      mce: 0.75\n    all_nonoutlier_ece_below: 0.015\n    ece_range:\n    - 0.0027\n    - 0.012\n    ece_ratio_vs_notrace_range:\n    - 14\n    - 63\n  result_rationale: 'Calibration 直接跟随 accuracy 和 error 数量。三个 99.83% 模型（Qwen-7B,  Qwen-1.5B,\n    CodeLlama-13B）仅有 2 个相同 error（GeneratorExit），calibration  差异仅来自 confidence distribution\n    的模型间差异：\n\n    Qwen-7B (ECE=0.0027, 已有数据): 基准。2 个 misclassified samples 的  confidence 贡献几乎全部\n    ECE。\n\n    CodeLlama-13B (ECE≈0.003): 13B 参数量产生更 peaked softmax distribution， correct predictions\n    的 confidence 更接近 1.0。2 个 error 的 confidence  也偏高（模型更 \"确定\"），但 overall 因 correct\n    predictions 的 near-perfect  calibration 而 ECE 极低。略高于 Qwen-7B 因为 CodeLlama 的 chat\n    template  与训练数据的 alignment 略有差异。\n\n    Qwen-1.5B (ECE≈0.005): 同 Qwen tokenizer，same 2 errors。但 1.5B 模型的  softmax entropy\n    更高（small model less confident），correct predictions  的 mean confidence 可能在 ~0.95\n    而非 ~0.99，造成 systematic slight  under-confidence → ECE 略高。\n\n    DeepSeek seed42 (ECE≈0.012): 8 个 errors（vs others 的 2 个），4× 更多  misclassified\n    bins 贡献 ECE。其中部分 fail samples 被高 confidence 预测为  pass（LoRA 训练不完全映射 exception→fail），这些\n    high-confidence wrong  predictions 是 ECE 的主要 contributor。但 0.012 仍远低于 no_trace\n    的 0.171  （14× improvement）。\n\n    总体：所有模型 ECE < 0.015，exception signal 的 calibration 优势跨模型  robust。magnitude 差异主要由\n    error count 驱动，非 signal quality 差异。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cross-model calibration for exception_only\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Accuracy\n    - ECE\n    - Brier\n    - ECE ratio vs no_trace (0.171)\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B\n      - 99.83%\n      - 0.0027\n      - 0.0013\n      - 63×\n    - - CodeLlama-13B-Instruct\n      - 99.83%\n      - 0.003\n      - 0.002\n      - 57×\n    - - Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B\n      - 99.83%\n      - 0.005\n      - 0.003\n      - 34×\n    - - DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B\n      - 99.33%\n      - 0.012\n      - 0.006\n      - 14×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Reliability diagram (2×2 grid): 每模型一 panel，predicted probability  vs observed\n    frequency。三个 99.83% 模型的 curves 紧贴 diagonal， DeepSeek 的 curve 在 0.8-0.95 bin 略偏（overconfident\n    on some  misclassified samples）。\n\n    '\n  - 'ECE comparison bar chart: 4 models × exception_only，with Qwen-7B  的 no_trace/full_trace/VOTA\n    ECE 作参考线。所有 exception_only bars  极短（≤0.012），no_trace reference line (0.171) 显著高。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Cross-model calibration 证实 exception signal 的 calibration 优势  不限于 Qwen-7B——所有\n    4 模型 ECE ≤ 0.012，与 no_trace ECE 0.171  相比 14-63× improvement。论文可 claim \"exception_only\n    achieves  near-perfect calibration (ECE ≤ 0.012) across all tested models,  regardless\n    of architecture and scale\"。这是独立于 accuracy 的  evidence dimension：即使审稿人质疑 99.83%\n    是 saturation，ECE/Brier  数据证明模型 \"knows what it knows\"——confidence 与 correctness  高度一致。DeepSeek\n    的略高 ECE (0.012) 与其更多 errors (8 vs 2)  一致，不 undermine overall finding。建议作为 main\n    text Table  （与 accuracy table 并列或合并为一张大表），1 GPU-hour  investment，cost-effective。\n\n    '\n- name: few_shot_frontier_baseline\n  plan_id: plan_020\n  description: GPT-4o/Claude 0-shot + 3-shot verdict prediction baseline\n  expected_results:\n    gpt4o_0shot_exception: 0.952\n    gpt4o_0shot_exception_ci:\n    - 0.937\n    - 0.965\n    gpt4o_3shot_exception: 0.966\n    gpt4o_3shot_exception_ci:\n    - 0.953\n    - 0.977\n    claude_0shot_exception: 0.958\n    claude_0shot_exception_ci:\n    - 0.944\n    - 0.971\n    claude_3shot_exception: 0.972\n    claude_3shot_exception_ci:\n    - 0.959\n    - 0.982\n    gpt4o_0shot_no_trace: 0.805\n    claude_0shot_no_trace: 0.821\n    sft_qwen7b_exception_only: 0.9983\n    sft_advantage_vs_best_frontier_pp: 2.6\n    sft_qwen15b_advantage_vs_gpt4o_pp: 2.6\n    api_cost_total_usd: 18\n    sft_inference_cost_usd: 0.01\n  result_rationale: 'Frontier models 的 exception_only 0-shot 能达 95-96% 因为 task 在  exception_only\n    格式下高度 interpretable：有 [ERROR] → fail，无 [ERROR] →  pass。已有 local model zero-shot\n    数据（Qwen-1.5B 93.45%, DeepSeek 90.59%） 证明不需要 SFT 就能达到 ~90%+。Frontier models 更强的\n    instruction following  + 更广的 code knowledge 在此基础上再提升 ~3-5pp：\n\n    (1) GPT-4o 0-shot 95.2%：比 local Qwen-1.5B zero-shot (93.45%) 仅高 1.8pp ——exception\n    task 对 model scale 的 marginal return 很低（进一步证明是  signal-limited not capacity-limited）。剩余\n    4.8% error 来自：GeneratorExit  等 non-fatal exceptions（同 SFT 模型）、format marker 的不一致解读、\n    边缘 case 的 conservative \"fail\" 偏好。\n\n    (2) 3-shot 额外 +1.4-1.4pp：exemplars 帮助建立 consistent decision  boundary，特别是处理 [No\n    exception data in trace] marker 的一致性。 但 3 个 exemplars 无法覆盖 exception type 的 long-tail\n    distribution。\n\n    (3) SFT Qwen-7B (99.83%) 仍高于 best frontier 3-shot (Claude 97.2%)  2.6pp。虽然 pp\n    gap 不大，但 error count 差异显著：2 vs ~33 errors， 16.5× fewer mistakes。且 SFT inference\n    cost 是 frontier API 的 ~1/1800。\n\n    (4) Frontier no_trace (80-82%) >> SFT no_trace (75.1%)：frontier model  的 code\n    reasoning 能力可部分替代 trace 信息，但仍远低于 SFT +  exception_only (99.83%)——exception signal\n    + SFT 的组合效果不可被  单纯 model scale 替代。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: SFT vs frontier few-shot comparison\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Model\n    - Input\n    - Shots\n    - Accuracy\n    - Errors/1190\n    - Approx Cost\n    rows:\n    - - SFT\n      - Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B\n      - exception_only\n      - —\n      - 99.83%\n      - 2\n      - $0.01\n    - - SFT\n      - Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B\n      - exception_only\n      - —\n      - 99.83%\n      - 2\n      - $0.005\n    - - SFT\n      - CodeLlama-13B\n      - exception_only\n      - —\n      - 99.83%\n      - 2\n      - $0.02\n    - - Few-shot\n      - GPT-4o\n      - exception_only\n      - 3\n      - 96.6%\n      - ~40\n      - $8\n    - - Few-shot\n      - Claude-3.5\n      - exception_only\n      - 3\n      - 97.2%\n      - ~33\n      - $10\n    - - Few-shot\n      - GPT-4o\n      - exception_only\n      - 0\n      - 95.2%\n      - ~57\n      - $5\n    - - Few-shot\n      - Claude-3.5\n      - exception_only\n      - 0\n      - 95.8%\n      - ~50\n      - $7\n    - - Few-shot\n      - GPT-4o\n      - no_trace\n      - 0\n      - 80.5%\n      - ~232\n      - $3\n    - - Few-shot\n      - Claude-3.5\n      - no_trace\n      - 0\n      - 82.1%\n      - ~213\n      - $5\n    - - SFT\n      - Qwen-7B\n      - no_trace\n      - —\n      - 75.1%\n      - 296\n      - $0.01\n  - name: Error count perspective (补充审稿人 'gap only 2-3pp' 的 concern)\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Accuracy\n    - Errors\n    - Error Reduction vs frontier best\n    rows:\n    - - SFT Qwen-7B exception_only\n      - 99.83%\n      - 2\n      - baseline\n    - - Claude 3-shot exception_only\n      - 97.2%\n      - ~33\n      - 16.5× more errors\n    - - GPT-4o 3-shot exception_only\n      - 96.6%\n      - ~40\n      - 20× more errors\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Accuracy bar chart: SFT models (4 bars at 99.83%) vs frontier  few-shot (4 bars\n    at 95-97%) vs frontier no_trace (2 bars at 80-82%). SFT advantage visually clear\n    despite small pp gap — the ceiling  region (99%+) makes absolute difference look\n    small but relative  error reduction is dramatic.\n\n    '\n  - 'Cost-accuracy scatter: x=log10(cost in $), y=accuracy (%). SFT  points cluster\n    in top-left (high accuracy, low cost), frontier  in bottom-right. Pareto frontier\n    clearly dominated by SFT.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Frontier baseline 在 median 档下提供 solid but not overwhelming  evidence：SFT\n    beats frontier 3-shot by ~2.6pp (error count 16-20×  reduction)。这足以 claim \"task-specific\n    SFT on 7B model surpasses  frontier few-shot\" 但审稿人可能视 2.6pp 为 modest。Rebuttal\n    策略： (a) 强调 error count 而非 pp——\"from ~33 errors to 2 irreducible  errors\" 更有冲击力；(b)\n    cost perspective——1800× cheaper；(c)  offline deployability。最有价值的发现：frontier models\n    也从  exception traces 大幅获益 (no_trace→exception: +14-15pp)， independent confirm\n    Claim 1/2。建议 main text 用 1 paragraph +  1 table 呈现，full results 放 appendix。0 GPU-hours，仅\n    API  cost ~$18。如果 deadline 紧张可 deprioritize——核心 claims  不依赖此数据。\n\n    '\n- name: ood_generalization_cross_language\n  plan_id: plan_021\n  description: 不同编程语言/项目的 trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性\n  expected_results:\n    python_ood_exception_only: 0.963\n    python_ood_degradation_pp: -3.5\n    java_exception_only: 0.918\n    java_degradation_pp: -8.0\n    javascript_exception_only: 0.902\n    javascript_degradation_pp: -9.6\n    cross_lang_mean: 0.928\n    cross_lang_mean_degradation_pp: -7.0\n    python_ood_no_trace: 0.715\n    java_no_trace: 0.68\n    javascript_no_trace: 0.665\n    exception_lift_over_notrace_ood_mean_pp: 24.1\n    ood_test_set_size_per_lang: 500\n  result_rationale: 'OOD 泛化性取决于 exception signal 的 cross-language structural similarity。\n    [ERROR] type: ... message: ... 格式是 tracer 的统一输出规范，但 exception  type 名称和 error\n    message 惯例跨语言不同，造成 token-level distribution shift。\n\n    Python OOD (-3.5pp, 96.3%): 同语言不同项目，exception type 分布与训练集  高度重叠（TypeError, ValueError,\n    IndexError 是 universal），仅 project-specific  custom exception classes 造成少量降级。测试集项目的\n    test structure（pytest  fixtures、多文件 import）可能引入不同的 exception context，但 [ERROR]\n    tag  的 binary signal 不受影响。\n\n    Java (-8.0pp, 91.8%): NullPointerException, ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException 等  Java-specific\n    type names 训练集未出现——模型无法利用 type-level semantics， 退化到依赖 [ERROR] tag presence 的 binary\n    heuristic。但 binary heuristic  本身在 Qwen-7B zero-shot 上已达 ~89%，SFT 的 fine-tuned\n    decision boundary  在新 type names 上部分失效。\n\n    JavaScript (-9.6pp, 90.2%): 最大降级。JS 的 error handling 更独特（Promise  rejection →\n    UnhandledPromiseRejection, async TypeError），且 error message  格式与 Python 差异最大。tracer\n    对 JS 的 [ERROR] 标注可能不如 Python  consistent（implementation difference）。\n\n    关键：所有语言上 exception_only lift over no_trace ≈ 24pp（与 in-domain  24.7pp 几乎相同），证明\n    exception signal 的 fault detection mechanism  跨语言 transferable。Absolute degradation\n    来自 token vocabulary shift  而非 mechanism failure。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: In-distribution vs OOD accuracy by language\n    columns:\n    - Language\n    - Setting\n    - exception_only\n    - no_trace\n    - Lift\n    - Degradation vs ID\n    rows:\n    - - Python\n      - ID (HumanEval+MBPP)\n      - 99.83%\n      - 75.1%\n      - +24.7pp\n      - baseline\n    - - Python\n      - OOD (new projects)\n      - 96.3%\n      - 71.5%\n      - +24.8pp\n      - -3.5pp\n    - - Java\n      - OOD\n      - 91.8%\n      - 68.0%\n      - +23.8pp\n      - -8.0pp\n    - - JavaScript\n      - OOD\n      - 90.2%\n      - 66.5%\n      - +23.7pp\n      - -9.6pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: 4 language settings × 2 conditions (exception_only  vs no_trace)。exception_only\n    lift (~24pp) 在所有 settings 上几乎  constant，即使 absolute accuracy drops。Visual emphasis\n    on preserved  lift rather than absolute degradation.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'OOD 实验在 median 档下是最大 risk/reward 投资。如果完成，可 claim  \"exception signal advantage\n    transfers across languages with preserved  lift (~24pp) despite moderate absolute\n    degradation (7pp mean)\"—— 部分回应 single-task scope criticism。但 risk factors：(1)\n    需要  构建 3 个语言的 OOD 数据集（trace 生成 + 人工验证），timeline  紧张；(2) tracer 对 Java/JS 的 implementation\n    可能有 quality  issues，影响实验可控性；(3) 如果某语言降到 <85%，审稿人可能  反向 argue \"not robust enough\"。在\n    ARR May 25 deadline (7天后)  前几乎不可能完成——建议 deprioritize，标注为 camera-ready  supplement\n    或 future work。如果有余力，优先做 Python OOD  （无需新 tracer，仅需新测试集），~4 GPU-hours 即可。\n\n    '\n- name: training_dynamics_learning_curves\n  plan_id: plan_022\n  description: exception_only vs full_trace 的 learning curve（每 ~50 steps eval）\n  expected_results:\n    exception_only_frac_to_90pct: 0.05\n    exception_only_frac_to_95pct: 0.08\n    exception_only_frac_to_99pct: 0.2\n    exception_only_curve_shape: monotonic_rapid_saturation\n    vota_frac_to_90pct: 0.1\n    vota_frac_to_95pct: 0.15\n    vota_frac_to_99pct: 0.3\n    vota_curve_shape: monotonic_moderate_saturation\n    full_trace_frac_to_80pct: 0.3\n    full_trace_peak:\n      accuracy: 0.83\n      epoch: 1\n    full_trace_final: 0.8176\n    full_trace_curve_shape: non_monotonic_epoch2_dip\n    no_trace_plateau_frac: 0.15\n    no_trace_plateau_accuracy: 0.751\n    no_trace_curve_shape: rapid_plateau_low_ceiling\n    convergence_ratio_exception_vs_vota: 1.9\n    convergence_ratio_exception_vs_fulltrace: 3.8\n    learning_efficiency_exception_samples_per_pp: 9.2\n    learning_efficiency_fulltrace_samples_per_pp: 68.5\n    efficiency_ratio: 7.4\n  result_rationale: 'Training dynamics 直接测量 information density 对 learning efficiency\n    的  影响。所有数值表示为 training fraction（0=start, 1.0=end of 3 epochs）， 因 absolute step\n    count 取决于 batch size 等 hyperparameters。\n\n    exception_only 收敛最快（~5% training 达 90%, ~8% 达 95%）：input 极短  （mean <100 tokens），gradient\n    完全集中在 verdict signal 上；effective  unique 样本仅 2858，但 binary structure（有 exception→fail,\n    无→pass） 极其 learnable。已有 epoch-level 数据佐证：Qwen-7B exception_only 3  seeds 均在 epoch1\n    结束时已达 99.83%（之后 epochs 无提升）——暗示  实际在 epoch1 早期就已收敛。\n\n    full_trace 收敛最慢且 non-monotonic：已有 epoch-level 数据  （epoch1=83.03%, epoch2=76.30%,\n    epoch3=81.76%）展示 epoch2 坍塌。 中间 eval 应能捕获更 fine-grained 的 oscillation pattern。峰值在  ~30%\n    training（epoch1 中后段），之后 overfitting 到 trace patterns  而非 verdict signal 导致 epoch2\n    下降。epoch3 partial recovery 可能  是 random fluctuation。\n\n    VOTA 介于两者之间：含 Tier 1 (fast learning) + Tier 2 (slow learning)  信号，combined curve\n    的前段被 Tier 1 驱动（快速上升到 >95%），后段  Tier 2 贡献边际提升。已有 epoch-level (epoch1=99.33%, epoch2-3=99.41%)  确认\n    epoch1 几乎完成所有学习。\n\n    no_trace 快速 plateau：无 trace signal 可学习，模型在 ~15% training  后耗尽 code→verdict 的弱\n    statistical correlation，之后 flat。\n\n    Learning efficiency ratio: exception_only 每 pp 需 ~9.2 个 effective  training samples（2858\n    unique / (99.83-75.13) pp），full_trace 需 ~68.5  （~5800 / (81.76-75.13) pp），7.4×\n    差距直接 quantify information  density 的 learning advantage。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Convergence milestones (fraction of total training)\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - To 80%\n    - To 90%\n    - To 95%\n    - To 99%\n    - Final Accuracy\n    - Curve Shape\n    rows:\n    - - exception_only\n      - ~3%\n      - ~5%\n      - ~8%\n      - ~20%\n      - 99.83%\n      - Rapid saturation\n    - - VOTA\n      - ~5%\n      - ~10%\n      - ~15%\n      - ~30%\n      - 99.41%\n      - Moderate saturation\n    - - full_trace\n      - ~30%\n      - never\n      - never\n      - never\n      - 81.76%\n      - Non-monotonic (epoch2 dip)\n    - - loop_only\n      - ~12%\n      - never\n      - never\n      - never\n      - 85.63%\n      - Slow saturation\n    - - no_trace\n      - never\n      - never\n      - never\n      - never\n      - 75.13%\n      - Low-ceiling plateau\n  - name: Learning efficiency comparison\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Effective Unique Samples\n    - Lift (pp)\n    - Samples per pp\n    - Efficiency (relative)\n    rows:\n    - - exception_only\n      - 2858\n      - 24.7\n      - 9.2\n      - 1.0× (ref)\n    - - VOTA\n      - ~5800\n      - 24.3\n      - 17.5\n      - 0.53×\n    - - full_trace\n      - ~5800\n      - 6.6\n      - 72.1\n      - 0.13×\n    - - no_trace\n      - ~5800\n      - 3.6\n      - 132.8\n      - 0.07×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Learning curve plot (main figure): x=training progress (fraction),  y=eval accuracy\n    (%). 4+ curves, eval points every ~2-3% of training. exception_only (red solid)\n    rockets up and saturates by ~10%,  VOTA (blue solid) follows ~2× slower. full_trace\n    (green dashed)  shows non-monotonic pattern with epoch2 dip. no_trace (gray dotted)  flat\n    at ~75%. Horizontal dashed line at 71.5% (majority baseline). Visual impact: exception_only\n    learning curve is dramatically  steeper than all others.\n\n    '\n  - 'Learning efficiency bar chart: samples-per-pp for each condition. exception_only\n    (9.2) vs full_trace (72.1) = 7.4× gap. Direct  visualization of information density\n    effect on learning.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Training dynamics 为 Claim 2 提供 process-level evidence（补充已有  outcome-level\n    evidence）。核心 finding：exception_only 不仅 final  accuracy 最高，learning efficiency\n    也 7.4× higher——denser signal  → faster and better learning。full_trace 的 non-monotonic\n    curve  （epoch2 dip from 83% to 76%）是 information overload 的 dynamic  manifestation：模型先学到\n    some useful trace patterns (epoch1 peak)， 然后 overfits to noise (epoch2 collapse)，部分恢复\n    (epoch3)。 这呼应 D1 (eval_loss vs accuracy decoupling)。\n\n    审稿人可能 challenge: \"faster convergence is trivially expected  for shorter sequences\"。Rebuttal:\n    shorter sequences + diagnostic  signal concentration 共同作用——loop_only 的 sequence\n    长度与  full_trace 相当但 efficiency 5× higher (因 loop 信号 denser than  raw trace)，证明不只是\n    length effect。\n\n    建议作为 Figure in main text（visual impact 强）但不升为  standalone claim。需修改 train_sft.py\n    添加 intermediate eval  callback，8 GPU-hours。如果 deadline 紧张，可引用现有  epoch-level 数据（epoch1\n    vs epoch3）作为 coarse-grained proxy  代替 fine-grained learning curve。'\n","numLines":948,"startLine":1,"totalLines":948}}}
